## Model card

- **Name:** GLM-4.5 Flash
- **Short description:** Z.AI's hosted Flash-tier SKU of the GLM-4.5 generation (launch-family alongside GLM-4.5 / GLM-4.5-Air) — free hosted endpoint, reasoning-capable, 131K context. The open-weight siblings are GLM-4.5 / GLM-4.5-Air; Flash is the closed free API route.
