- **Release / knowledge:** 2025-07-28; knowledge cutoff not publicly stated.
- **IDs:** `glm-4.5-flash` (Z.ai)
- **Context window:** 131,072 tokens; max output 98,304 tokens (models.dev).
- **Modalities:** text in → text out; reasoning yes; tool calls yes; structured outputs yes.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $0.00 / $0.00 — free hosted rate (models.dev); rate limits apply.
- **Architecture:** proprietary hosted; parameter count undisclosed (GLM-4.5-family MoE pattern presumed).

